        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings Agent,\r\rContracts have been seperately placed for Amos Dexter, Axel George, and Jason Portman. These three business moguls have been aggressively asserting themselves in the Japanese marketplace, and have seen a surprising margin of success, much to our client&apos;s dismay.\r\rOur intel shows that all three of them are currently residing at the GAMA facility in Hokkaido, Japan. This could be the perfect opportunity to take them all out at once.\r\rGood luck, Agent.",
